h the\n81\t  publication reference recorded.\n82\t\n83\t## HLR Traceability\n84\t\n85\t- HLR-4 (P2 — publish a whitepaper describing enterprise usability best\n86\t  practices on RHOAI): direct coverage — the whitepaper is outlined, authored,\n87\t  technically reviewed, and published. Content accuracy draws on the resolved\n88\t  outcomes of the HLR-1, HLR-2, and HLR-3 investigations.\n89\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-911da1c170635ad9","agent_id":"a72c63146fcb16e0c","session_id":"fedb8ce9-e0a4-4a22-8d10-7c9db2355a36","uuid":"4a7e25b3-3d8e-451a-b82b-dac6a30164cf","timestamp":"2026-10-22T18:06:47.894Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-9c3a4f8b66dd5418","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Re-review RHAISTRAT-9008"}
